cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bruting Calls: BirdNET call detection, verification and reporting for Demeter acoustic recordings"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-04
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Abhimanyu Raj
    # orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000
keywords:
  - bioacoustics
  - BirdNET
  - passive acoustic monitoring
  - Shiny
  - Demeter Insights
abstract: >-
  A Shiny app (Python and R front-ends) that runs BirdNET on passive acoustic recordings,
  supports human verification of low-confidence detections, and reports species, call
  counts per day, call timing, durations, intervals and frequency as a PDF and CSV tables.
